      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The same shell as Insight, Paper, Design, Task and Labeling: title, band, Space row with Guide first, plain Space names, one box per Space, Runs folded to a strip. No `all boards · board index` line. Address: /w/<board>/<page>.",
