      "text": "1. Each Space shows the whole page; a selected paragraph, row or opened card sets the Runs target.\n2. Each view lists only its own run types (the views word on run-cards.md buttons); + New Run adds one.\n3. Pick a run: its prompt (folded; Copy it to run it yourself), its process and its results.\n4. Rerun starts the same prompt again as a new run; nothing is overwritten.\n5. Only Accept writes a Markdown, as a new version; Delivery only reads.\n6. Names: run-<kind>-<MMDD>-<slug> (run-paragraph-0928-c1-p2); Delivery keeps run-delivery-<lane>; each run shows its skill.",
      "originalText": "1. Each Space shows the whole page; a selected paragraph, row or opened card sets the Runs target.\n2. Each view lists only its own run types (the views word on run-cards.md buttons); + New Run adds one.\n3. Pick a run: its prompt (folded; Copy it to run it yourself), its process and its results.\n4. Rerun starts the same prompt again as a new run; nothing is overwritten.\n5. Only Accept writes a Markdown, as a new version; Delivery only reads.\n6. Names: run-<kind>-<MMDD>-<slug> (run-paragraph-0928-c1-p2); Delivery keeps run-delivery-<lane>; each run shows its skill.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
