      "text": "1. Fold one panel: click ▸ / ◂ on its Runs title.\n2. A run that needs you never pops open: the folded strip turns green instead.\n3. The panel stays on the right at every page width; the content takes the rest.\n4. Your choice is remembered in this browser, per Space.",
