    {
      "id": "flow-notes",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48,
      "y": 2740,
      "width": 1164.24,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1709063910,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 587999400,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790653552717,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Each Space shows only its own runs, view by view; the number is the usual order, Check can send the Page back.\n2. A run opens (one ticket, runs/<name>.md), changes only the text, and closes when you say (results/<name>/ + one log line).\n3. Names: run-<kind>-<MMDD>-<slug>, a taken name gets -2; the three Delivery runs keep one fixed name each and are rebuilt in place.\n4. Every run in the Runs panel shows its skill (the 🧩 SKILL line of its card in run-cards.md).\n5. Code, not runs: page.py adopt (Draft → Page) and page.py export (Page → web, LaTeX, Word).",
      "originalText": "1. Each Space shows only its own runs, view by view; the number is the usual order, Check can send the Page back.\n2. A run opens (one ticket, runs/<name>.md), changes only the text, and closes when you say (results/<name>/ + one log line).\n3. Names: run-<kind>-<MMDD>-<slug>, a taken name gets -2; the three Delivery runs keep one fixed name each and are rebuilt in place.\n4. Every run in the Runs panel shows its skill (the 🧩 SKILL line of its card in run-cards.md).\n5. Code, not runs: page.py adopt (Draft → Page) and page.py export (Page → web, LaTeX, Word).",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48,
      "y": 1580,
      "width": 1132.8799999999999,
      "height": 42.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
